<h4>
    Why Use Demo Text?
    Visual Aid: Demo text allows designers and clients to focus on the design elements without being distracted by the actual content.
    Content Planning: It helps in planning the layout and structure of content-heavy projects such as websites and brochures.
    Client Presentations: Using demo text in presentations helps in showing clients how the final product will look, providing a clearer vision of the end result.
    Efficiency: It speeds up the design process by providing a quick and easy way to visualize content placement.
</h4>

